<!--
  Launcher field colour, miner.

  Graphite, shared with the wallet. The two apps used to differ only by this
  colour, which meant they were indistinguishable in greyscale and to a
  colour-blind user. They are now told apart by SHAPE instead: the wallet
  carries a base plate with WALLET struck out of it, the miner does not.

  14.2:1 against the white mark, the highest of the ten fields that were
  measured. That matters more than it sounds: the milled edge is fine detail,
  and below roughly 3:1 the teeth stop resolving at 48dp and read as a smudge.
-->
<resources>
    <color name="ic_launcher_background">#262B33</color>
</resources>
